      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        414.7434997558594,
        527.3793334960938,
        429.1865234375
      ],
      "text": "between 0 and 19 years of age, comprising both children (0–9 years of age) and adolescents (10–19",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        427.9435119628906,
        527.4124145507812,
        442.38653564453125
      ],
      "text": "years of age), was conducted to answer this group of PICO questions. The PubMed, Embase, Web",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        441.14349365234375,
        527.4266357421875,
        455.5865173339844
      ],
      "text": "of Science, Global Index Medicus, Global Health and Cochrane Central databases were searched in",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        454.343505859375,
        527.6128540039062,
        468.7865295410156
      ],
      "text": "February 2021, as were the references of 17 related reviews. A total of 3265 abstracts from databases",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.991796493530273,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        467.54351806640625,
        527.2615356445312,
        481.9865417480469
      ],
      "text": "and 129 additional references from related reviews were identified and assessed. Of these, 516",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        480.7434997558594,
        527.3936157226562,
        495.1865234375
      ],
      "text": "full-text articles were assessed for eligibility, from which 25 comparative studies (7 randomized, 18",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        493.9435119628906,
        527.395751953125,
        508.38653564453125
      ],
      "text": "observational) were identified; one unpublished observational study was added, making a total of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        507.14349365234375,
        527.31787109375,
        521.5864868164062
      ],
      "text": "26 studies. Four studies (1 randomized, 3 observational) were excluded after review because the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        520.343505859375,
        527.6067504882812,
        534.7864990234375
      ],
      "text": "care model described was community-based treatment support, for which a WHO recommendation",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.998250007629395,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        532.2675170898438,
        527.5437622070312,
        547.9865112304688
      ],
      "text": "(138) already exists  . Of the remaining studies that were included, 16 had elements of decentralization,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 10.985190391540527,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        546.7435302734375,
        527.4299926757812,
        561.1865234375
      ],
      "text": "five had elements of integration, and three had elements of family-centred care. Four studies had",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        559.9434814453125,
        527.4202880859375,
        574.386474609375
      ],
      "text": "elements of more than one care model of interest but were included only on the basis of their main",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
