      ],
      "text": "the 0–14-year age group.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        622.1572875976562,
        526.342529296875,
        635.9412841796875
      ],
      "text": "Decentralization:  Depending on the standard in the research settings used for the comparator, decentralization includes the provision  76",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 7.997049331665039,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        81.86609649658203,
        635.0372924804688,
        526.5567016601562,
        645.541259765625
      ],
      "text": "of, access to or capacity for child and adolescent TB services at a lower level of the health system than the lowest level at which this is",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        81.86609649658203,
        644.6373291015625,
        526.6170043945312,
        655.1412963867188
      ],
      "text": "currently routinely provided. In most settings, decentralization would apply to the district hospital (first referral level hospital) and/or",
